      },
      "dateof": {
        "birth": "",
        "death": ""
      },
      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>FIRSTLIGHT tactical team breacher, former Army combat engineer</td></tr><tr><th>Age</th><td>41</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>Retire with the house paid off before forty-five.</td></tr><tr><th>Desire</th><td>One night on the job without anyone saying “subject.”</td></tr><tr><th>Dice pools</th><td>Physical 6 · Social 2 · Mental 4 · Firearms 7 · Athletics 5 · Awareness 5 · Brawl 5</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Forty-one, blonde, broad-shouldered, hands covered in small scars. Chews nicotine gum. Counts under her breath before every door.</p><p>One of the six operators of @UUID[Actor.abaWg7NwNQvM0sDc]{FIRSTLIGHT Tactical Team}. The van&#39;s generator takes two turns to start; she says in her hands it takes one and a half.</p><h3>Hunter</h3><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Cell</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.dnsWkdXVJ19riBLa.JournalEntryPage.O8yPSIYLlTrKHm8G]{Puget Cell}</td></tr><tr><th>Creed</th><td>Entrepreneurial. <em>Desperation:</em> Building, inventing, augmenting or repairing during the Hunt.</td></tr><tr><th>Drive</th><td>Greed. <em>Redemption:</em> She finds redemption when the hunt leaves her something of value (money, an object, a favor she can call in) and she uses it to close out a debt.</td></tr><tr><th>Edges</th><td>Ordnance (Handmade)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>She grew up in Ballard, a fisherman&#39;s daughter. She owes on her mother&#39;s house and on another debt she doesn&#39;t talk about. FIRSTLIGHT pays for risk at federal rates, and she bills it by the hour. What she takes home from each operation, she&#39;s already counted.</p><p>@UUID[JournalEntry.LfywH6qtS3GxDxJx.JournalEntryPage.hKlrjorCoIiKhIi8]{Pregen: Lena Sorensen · Breacher}</p>",
    "appearance": "<p>Forty-one, blonde, broad-shouldered, hands covered in small scars. Chews nicotine gum. Counts under her breath before every door.</p>",
    "equipment": "",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<h3>Proposed (not in the docs)</h3><ul><li>The whole character is proposed. Conversion of the @UUID[Actor.abaWg7NwNQvM0sDc]{FIRSTLIGHT Tactical Team} pools (Physical 6, Social 2, Mental 4; Firearms 7, Athletics 5, Awareness 5, Brawl 5; Health 7, Willpower 5) to Attributes and Skills: Dexterity 3 + Firearms 4, Dexterity 3 + Athletics 2, Strength 3 + Brawl 2, Wits 3 + Awareness 2; Health = Stamina 4 + 3; Willpower = Composure 3 + Resolve 2. Craft (Explosives), Science, Drive, and Medicine are her own.</li><li>Entrepreneurial Creed (she builds charges, fixes the generator, improvises), Greed Drive, Ordnance Edge with the “Handmade” Perk. The generator is the one from the doc 14 arsenal; that she&#39;s the one who runs it is proposed.</li><li>Resources 1 Advantage and Debt 1 Flaw.</li></ul>",
